      "trackName": "Maze - Watch Game",
      "description": "A clean maze game designed for iPhone and Apple Watch.\n\nSwipe in any direction and your marker will move automatically to the next junction or dead end. Study the paths, choose your route, and reach the green goal.\n\n• 200 levels with steadily increasing difficulty\n• Zoom with the Digital Crown on Apple Watch\n• Pinch to zoom and drag to explore on iPhone\n• A clear, distraction-free interface with no ads",
